585	 * Proxmox RRD's `disk` field is 0 for QEMU VMs — the hypervisor can't see
586	 * in-guest usage — so this agent call is the only source of real used/total
587	 * bytes. Best-effort: returns null on any error or when the agent isn't ready
588	 * (never throws), so a missing agent degrades cleanly to the provisioned-size
589	 * fallback. In SANDBOX returns a synthetic, gently-varying realistic value.
